  <diagram id="uc04_accessmeetingviaguestinvitation" name="UC-04 - Access Meeting via Guest Invitation">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc04_accessmeetingviaguestinvitation" label="" mermaidData="{&amp;quot;data&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;%%{init: {\&amp;quot;sequence\&amp;quot;: {\&amp;quot;mirrorActors\&amp;quot;: false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
actor Guest as \&amp;quot;Guest\&amp;quot;
participant Page@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;boundary\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;Guest Invitation Page\&amp;quot;
participant Controller@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Guest Access Controller\&amp;quot;
participant Service@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Guest Access Service\&amp;quot;
participant Repository as \&amp;quot;:Guest Invitation Repository\&amp;quot;
participant Database@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;database\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Database\&amp;quot;
participant Email as \&amp;quot;:Email Service\&amp;quot;
Guest-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Open invitation and request access, or reopen the invitation
activate Page
Page-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Start or resume access via Guest invitation
activate Controller
Controller-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Check invitation and existing verified Guest access
activate Service
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repository: Read current invitation, verification challenge and Guest access
activate Repository
Repository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Read invitation status/expiry, challenge and access
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repository: Current information / Read failure
Repository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Current information / Read failure
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Check current invitation and Meeting scope (BR-152–BR-157)
alt Invitation is missing, expired or revoked - EX-1
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Deny access; no protected Meeting content
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Invitation is no longer valid
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Guest: Invitation is no longer valid
else Verification/access service is unavailable - EX-3
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Verification could not be completed; no Guest session
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Verification unavailable
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Guest: Verification unavailable
else Invitation is current
alt Reopen already verified active Guest session - ALT-1
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Reuse access only for this invited Meeting; do not request another code
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Invited Meeting and allowed Member participation actions
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Display invited Meeting; subsequent requests recheck access
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Guest: Invited Meeting available
else First access without verified email
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repository: Prepare one-time code for the invited email only (BR-153)
Repository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Save verification challenge
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repository: Saved / Failure
Repository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Challenge result
alt Challenge cannot be saved - EX-3
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Verification unavailable; no Guest session
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Verification unavailable
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Guest: Verification unavailable
else Challenge saved
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Email: Send code to the invited email (BR-153)
activate Email
Email--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Delivery accepted / Failure
alt Email delivery cannot be arranged - EX-3
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Verification unavailable; no Guest session
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Verification unavailable
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Guest: Verification unavailable
else Code delivered
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Request one-time code entry
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Display invited-email code entry
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Guest: Enter the code sent to the invited email
Guest-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Submit the one-time code
Page-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Verify code for this invitation
Controller-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Verify code and current invitation
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Check correct, unexpired, unused code and invited-email binding (BR-153)
alt Code is incorrect, expired or already used - EX-2
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: MSG126 - Unable to verify the guest invitation. Check the code and try again.
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: MSG126 - Unable to verify the guest invitation. Check the code and try again.
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Guest: MSG126 - Unable to verify the guest invitation. Check the code and try again.
else Code and invitation are valid
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repository: Consume code and record invited-email verification consistently
Repository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Save verification; recheck current invitation and unused challenge
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repository: Verification saved / Conflict / Failure
Repository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Verification result
alt Code was consumed by a concurrent request - EX-2
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: MSG126 - Unable to verify the guest invitation. Check the code and try again.
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: MSG126 - Unable to verify the guest invitation. Check the code and try again.
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Guest: MSG126 - Unable to verify the guest invitation. Check the code and try again.
else Verification cannot be saved - EX-3
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Verification not completed; no Guest session
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Verification could not be completed
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Guest: Verification could not be completed
else Invited-email control verified
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Continue with self-declared display information
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Show display name and job title entry; invited email remains unchanged
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Guest: Enter display name and optional job title for presentation
Guest-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Submit self-declared display information
Page-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Complete invited-Meeting access
Controller-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Complete Guest access for this invitation
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Keep display fields self-declared, separate from verified email (BR-180)
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repository: Save display information and establish Meeting-scoped Guest access
Repository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Save profile and Guest access
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Repository: Saved / Failure
Repository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Access result
Service-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Service: Apply Guest Member participation and permitted additional grants;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;no internal account, system role or Chair/Secretary authority (BR-181)
alt Access cannot be completed - EX-3
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: No successful Guest access
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Access could not be completed
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Guest: Access could not be completed
else Guest access is established
Service--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Controller: Invited Meeting and allowed Member participation actions
Controller--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Page: Display invited Meeting; subsequent requests recheck access
Page--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Guest: Invited Meeting available; email verified, display information self-declared
end
end
end
end
deactivate Email
end
end
end
deactivate Database
deactivate Repository
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate Page
