  <diagram id="uc07_resetuserpassword" name="UC-07 - Reset User Password">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc07_resetuserpassword" label="" mermaidData="{&amp;quot;data&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;%%{init: {\&amp;quot;sequence\&amp;quot;: {\&amp;quot;mirrorActors\&amp;quot;: false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
actor Admin as \&amp;quot;System Admin\&amp;quot;
participant UserPage@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;boundary\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;User Management Page\&amp;quot;
participant UserController@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:User Controller\&amp;quot;
participant UserService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:User Service\&amp;quot;
participant UserRepository as \&amp;quot;:User Repository\&amp;quot;
participant ResetTokenStore as \&amp;quot;:Password Reset Token Store\&amp;quot;
participant EmailService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Email Service\&amp;quot;
participant AuditService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Audit Service\&amp;quot;
participant Database@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;database\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Database\&amp;quot;
Admin-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserPage: Confirm password reset
activate UserPage
UserPage-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserController: Reset user password
activate UserController
UserController-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserService: requestPasswordReset(userId, adminId)
activate UserService
UserService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserRepository: Get user account
activate UserRepository
UserRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Retrieve user account
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserRepository: User account
deactivate Database
UserRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserService: User account
deactivate UserRepository
alt User account no longer exists - EX-3
UserService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserController: User account not found
deactivate UserService
UserController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserPage: Return not found
deactivate UserController
UserPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: Inform that the account no longer exists&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;and refresh the User Accounts list
else User account exists
activate UserController
activate UserService
UserService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserService: Check eligibility: account is active&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;and signs in with a password (BR-22)
alt Account is deactivated or has no password - EX-1
UserService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserController: MSG14 - Password reset is not available&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;for this account
deactivate UserService
UserController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserPage: Return failure
deactivate UserController
UserPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: MSG14 - Password reset is not available&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;for this account
else Account is eligible
activate UserController
activate UserService
UserService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ResetTokenStore: Create password reset request&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;(60-minute, single-use link) (BR-20)
activate ResetTokenStore
ResetTokenStore--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserService: Reset link, not usable yet
deactivate ResetTokenStore
UserService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;EmailService: Send password reset email
activate EmailService
alt Email cannot be sent - EX-2
EmailService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserService: Email delivery failed
deactivate EmailService
UserService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserController: MSG15 - Unable to send the password reset email.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Please try again.
deactivate UserService
UserController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserPage: Return failure
deactivate UserController
UserPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: MSG15 - Unable to send the password reset email.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Please try again.
else Email sent successfully
activate EmailService
activate UserController
activate UserService
EmailService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserService: Password reset email sent
deactivate EmailService
UserService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ResetTokenStore: Make the new link usable and&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;retire the previous link (BR-20)
activate ResetTokenStore
ResetTokenStore--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserService: Link activated
deactivate ResetTokenStore
UserService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;AuditService: Record password reset request&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;(actor: System Admin) (BR-16)
activate AuditService
AuditService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Store audit record
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;AuditService: Audit record stored
deactivate Database
AuditService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserService: Password reset request recorded
deactivate AuditService
UserService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserController: Password reset email sent
deactivate UserService
UserController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserPage: MSG13 - Password reset email sent successfully
deactivate UserController
UserPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Admin: MSG13 - Password reset email sent successfully
end
end
end
deactivate UserPage
