cannot be created - EX-2 Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Creation failed deactivate Database MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Meeting creation failed deactivate MeetingRepository MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG35 - Unable to create the meeting.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Please try again deactivate MeetingService MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return meeting creation failure deactivate MeetingController MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG35 - Unable to create the meeting.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Please try again else Meeting created successfully activate Database activate MeetingController activate MeetingRepository activate MeetingService Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Meeting created deactivate Database MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Created meeting deactivate MeetingRepository MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: Meeting created successfully deactivate MeetingService MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: MSG29 - Meeting created successfully deactivate MeetingController MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG29 - Meeting created successfully end end deactivate MeetingPage &amp;quot;, &amp;quot;config&amp;quot;: null}">
