  <diagram id="uc20_publishmeeting" name="UC-20 - Publish Meeting">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc20_publishmeeting" label="" mermaidData="{&amp;quot;data&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;%%{init: {\&amp;quot;sequence\&amp;quot;: {\&amp;quot;mirrorActors\&amp;quot;: false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
actor Organizer as \&amp;quot;Meeting Organizer\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingPage@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;boundary\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;Meeting Management Page\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingController@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Controller\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Service\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingRepository as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Repository\&amp;quot;
participant UserRepository as \&amp;quot;:User Repository\&amp;quot;
participant ParticipantRepository as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Participant Repository\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationService as \&amp;quot;:Notification Service\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationRepository as \&amp;quot;:Notification Repository\&amp;quot;
participant InvitationQueue as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Invitation Queue\&amp;quot;
participant Database@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;database\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Database\&amp;quot;
Organizer-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Publish Approved meeting
activate MeetingPage
MeetingPage-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: Publish meeting
activate MeetingController
MeetingController-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: publishMeeting(meetingId, organizerId)
activate MeetingService
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Get meeting and current publication state
activate MeetingRepository
MeetingRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Retrieve meeting and Organizer assignment
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Meeting and publication state
deactivate Database
MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Meeting and publication state
deactivate MeetingRepository
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserRepository: Verify current Organizer is active and has MeetingCreator
activate UserRepository
UserRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Check Organizer account and capability
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;UserRepository: Organizer eligibility
deactivate Database
UserRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Organizer eligibility
deactivate UserRepository
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantRepository: Get current Chair and Secretary assignments with active accounts (BR-124, BR-125)
activate ParticipantRepository
ParticipantRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Retrieve current required-role holders and account status
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantRepository: Active Chair and Secretary assignments
deactivate Database
ParticipantRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Required-role readiness
deactivate ParticipantRepository
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Revalidate Organizer, Approved status,&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;exactly one active current Chair and at least one active Secretary (BR-37, BR-124, BR-125)
alt Meeting is not Approved, Organizer is ineligible, or required active Chair/Secretary is missing - EX-1
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG46 - This meeting can no longer be published
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return publication restriction
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG46 - This meeting can no longer be published
else Organizer is eligible, meeting is Approved, and required active roles exist
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingService
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Revalidate publication readiness; record Published status&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;and publication history together (BR-37, BR-38, BR-41, BR-124, BR-125)
activate MeetingRepository
MeetingRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Save Published status and publication history as one complete action
activate Database
alt Publication cannot be completed - EX-2
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Status or history could not be completed; Meeting remains Approved and previous information unchanged
deactivate Database
MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Publication failed
deactivate MeetingRepository
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: MSG47 - Unable to publish the meeting. Please try again
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Return publication failure; no notification or invitation issued
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG47 - Unable to publish the meeting. Please try again
else Meeting published
activate Database
activate MeetingController
activate MeetingRepository
activate MeetingService
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingRepository: Published status and publication history recorded together
deactivate Database
MeetingRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Published meeting
deactivate MeetingRepository
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Notify current internal participants except the publishing Organizer (BR-39)
activate NotificationService
NotificationService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Create invitation notifications, excluding the publishing Organizer
activate NotificationRepository
NotificationRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Record internal participant notifications
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Notifications recorded / delivery unavailable
deactivate Database
NotificationRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Notification result
deactivate NotificationRepository
NotificationService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Notifications issued / retry delivery; Meeting remains Published (BR-40)
deactivate NotificationService
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;InvitationQueue: Send invitation emails to all current internal participants,&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;including the publishing Organizer (BR-39)
activate InvitationQueue
InvitationQueue--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Email delivery arranged / retry delivery; Meeting remains Published (BR-40)
deactivate InvitationQueue
MeetingService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;InvitationQueue: Send a separate email invitation to each current external Guest&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;to verify the invited email address and access only this Meeting (BR-39, BR-152, BR-153)
activate InvitationQueue
InvitationQueue--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingService: Guest invitation delivery arranged / retry delivery; Meeting remains Published (BR-40)
deactivate InvitationQueue
MeetingService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingController: Publication successful
deactivate MeetingService
MeetingController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: MSG45 - Meeting published successfully
deactivate MeetingController
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Organizer: MSG45 - Meeting published successfully
end
end
deactivate MeetingPage
&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;config&amp;quot;: null}">
