  <diagram id="uc23a_createagendaitem" name="UC-23a - Create Agenda Item">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc23a_createagendaitem" label="" mermaidData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;%%{init: {\&quot;sequence\&quot;: {\&quot;mirrorActors\&quot;: false}}}%%\nsequenceDiagram\nactor Secretary as \&quot;Secretary\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingPage@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;boundary\&quot; } as \&quot;Meeting Management Page\&quot;\nparticipant AgendaController@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Agenda Controller\&quot;\nparticipant AgendaService@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Agenda Service\&quot;\nparticipant NotificationService@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Notification Service\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingRepository as \&quot;:Meeting Repository\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingParticipantRepository as \&quot;:Meeting Participant Repository\&quot;\nparticipant AgendaItemRepository as \&quot;:Agenda Item Repository\&quot;\nparticipant DocumentRepository as \&quot;:Document Repository\&quot;\nparticipant Database@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;database\&quot; } as \&quot;:Database\&quot;\nSecretary-&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: Create Agenda Item\nactivate MeetingPage\nMeetingPage-&gt;&gt;AgendaController: Create Agenda Item\nactivate AgendaController\nAgendaController-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: createAgendaItem(meetingId, secretaryId, agendaInfo, presenterId, documentIds)\nactivate AgendaService\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;MeetingRepository: Get selected Meeting and current status\nactivate MeetingRepository\nMeetingRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Get selected Meeting and current status\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;MeetingRepository: Meeting / Not found\ndeactivate Database\nMeetingRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Meeting / Not found\ndeactivate MeetingRepository\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;MeetingParticipantRepository: Check active current Secretary assignment\nactivate MeetingParticipantRepository\nMeetingParticipantRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Check active current Secretary assignment\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;MeetingParticipantRepository: Active Secretary / Not eligible\ndeactivate Database\nMeetingParticipantRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Active Secretary / Not eligible\ndeactivate MeetingParticipantRepository\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Verify Secretary and permitted Meeting status&lt;br/&gt;Draft, WaitingApproval, Rejected, Approved, Published or InProgress (BR-65, BR-74)\nalt Agenda planning no longer permitted - EX-2\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG67 - The agenda for this meeting can no longer be modified.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG67 - The agenda for this meeting can no longer be modified.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Secretary: MSG67 - The agenda for this meeting can no longer be modified.\nelse Agenda planning permitted\nopt Presenter selected\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;MeetingParticipantRepository: Verify Presenter is a current internal participant&lt;br/&gt;or current Guest of this Meeting (BR-306)\nactivate MeetingParticipantRepository\nMeetingParticipantRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Verify Presenter is a current internal participant&lt;br/&gt;or current Guest of this Meeting (BR-306)\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;MeetingParticipantRepository: Current participant or Guest / Invalid Presenter\ndeactivate Database\nMeetingParticipantRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Current participant or Guest / Invalid Presenter\ndeactivate MeetingParticipantRepository\nend\nopt Meeting documents selected\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;DocumentRepository: Verify selected documents belong to this Meeting\nactivate DocumentRepository\nDocumentRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Verify selected documents belong to this Meeting\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;DocumentRepository: Available documents / Invalid selection\ndeactivate Database\nDocumentRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Available documents / Invalid selection\ndeactivate DocumentRepository\nend\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Validate required Title, optional Presenter and Description,&lt;br/&gt;and selected documents (BR-66, BR-306)\nalt Invalid Item information - EX-1\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG66 - Invalid agenda item information.&lt;br/&gt;Applicable field messages; no Item created\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG66 - Invalid agenda item information.&lt;br/&gt;Applicable field messages; no Item created\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Secretary: MSG66 - Invalid agenda item information.&lt;br/&gt;Applicable field messages; no Item created\nelse Item information valid\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Get current Meeting Agenda positions\nactivate AgendaItemRepository\nAgendaItemRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Get current Meeting Agenda positions\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Saved positions / Empty Agenda\ndeactivate Database\nAgendaItemRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Saved positions / Empty Agenda\ndeactivate AgendaItemRepository\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Save new Pending Item and document associations together&lt;br/&gt;after the last position; preserve existing positions (BR-67)\nactivate AgendaItemRepository\nAgendaItemRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Save new Pending Item and document associations together&lt;br/&gt;after the last position; preserve existing positions (BR-67)\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Change saved / Save failed; previous Agenda preserved\ndeactivate Database\nAgendaItemRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Change saved / Save failed; previous Agenda preserved\ndeactivate AgendaItemRepository\nalt Change cannot be saved - EX-3\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG68 - Unable to create the agenda item. Please try again.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG68 - Unable to create the agenda item. Please try again.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Secretary: MSG68 - Unable to create the agenda item. Please try again.\nelse Change saved successfully\nopt Presenter set while Meeting is Published or InProgress\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;NotificationService: Notify the Presenter: internal user in the application&lt;br/&gt;(not when the assignee is the actor, BR-322),&lt;br/&gt;Guest by email (BR-307)\nactivate NotificationService\nNotificationService--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Notification created / delivery failed&lt;br/&gt;(failure does not undo the change)\ndeactivate NotificationService\nend\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Automatically refresh the complete saved Agenda&lt;br/&gt;for currently authorized users viewing this Meeting (BR-73)\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG60 - Agenda item created successfully.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG60 - Agenda item created successfully.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Secretary: MSG60 - Agenda item created successfully.\nend\nend\nend\ndeactivate AgendaService\ndeactivate AgendaController\ndeactivate MeetingPage&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" vertex="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=20;">
            <mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="3592.0" height="46.0" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
