  <diagram id="uc77_recordagendaitemconclusion" name="UC-77 - Record Agenda Item Conclusion">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc77_recordagendaitemconclusion" label="" mermaidData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;%%{init: {\&quot;sequence\&quot;: {\&quot;mirrorActors\&quot;: false}}}%%\nsequenceDiagram\nactor Actor as \&quot;Chair / Secretary\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingPage@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;boundary\&quot; } as \&quot;Meeting Management Page\&quot;\nparticipant AgendaController@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Agenda Controller\&quot;\nparticipant AgendaService@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Agenda Service\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingRepository as \&quot;:Meeting Repository\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingParticipantRepository as \&quot;:Meeting Participant Repository\&quot;\nparticipant AgendaItemRepository as \&quot;:Agenda Item Repository\&quot;\nparticipant MinutesRepository as \&quot;:Minutes Repository\&quot;\nparticipant Database@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;database\&quot; } as \&quot;:Database\&quot;\nActor-&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: Save Agenda Item conclusion\nactivate MeetingPage\nMeetingPage-&gt;&gt;AgendaController: Record Agenda Item Conclusion\nactivate AgendaController\nAgendaController-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: recordAgendaItemConclusion(meetingId, agendaItemId, actorId, conclusion)\nactivate AgendaService\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;MeetingRepository: Get selected Meeting and current status\nactivate MeetingRepository\nMeetingRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Get selected Meeting and current status\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;MeetingRepository: Meeting / Not found\ndeactivate Database\nMeetingRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Meeting / Not found\ndeactivate MeetingRepository\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Get selected Item and Meeting membership\nactivate AgendaItemRepository\nAgendaItemRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Get selected Item and Meeting membership\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Item and current status / Not found\ndeactivate Database\nAgendaItemRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Item and current status / Not found\ndeactivate AgendaItemRepository\nalt Meeting not accessible or Item no longer exists - EX-4\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG174 - This Meeting is not accessible.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG174 - This Meeting is not accessible.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Actor: MSG174 - This Meeting is not accessible.\nelse Meeting and Item available\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;MeetingParticipantRepository: Check current Chair or Secretary assignment\nactivate MeetingParticipantRepository\nMeetingParticipantRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Check current Chair or Secretary assignment\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;MeetingParticipantRepository: Current Chair or Secretary / Not eligible\ndeactivate Database\nMeetingParticipantRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Current Chair or Secretary / Not eligible\ndeactivate MeetingParticipantRepository\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;MinutesRepository: Check whether the minutes draft has been generated\nactivate MinutesRepository\nMinutesRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Check whether the minutes draft has been generated\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;MinutesRepository: Draft generated / Not generated\ndeactivate Database\nMinutesRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Draft generated / Not generated\ndeactivate MinutesRepository\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Verify Chair or Secretary, Item InProgress or Done,&lt;br/&gt;Meeting InProgress or Ended without a minutes draft (BR-310)\nalt Conclusion can no longer be changed - EX-2\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG273 - The conclusion of this agenda item can no longer be changed.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG273 - The conclusion of this agenda item can no longer be changed.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Actor: MSG273 - The conclusion of this agenda item can no longer be changed.\nelse Change permitted\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Validate conclusion is not blank and has at most 2,000 characters (BR-309)\nalt Conclusion blank or too long - EX-1\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG272 - Enter a conclusion of up to 2,000 characters.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG272 - Enter a conclusion of up to 2,000 characters.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Actor: MSG272 - Enter a conclusion of up to 2,000 characters.\nelse Conclusion valid\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Save the conclusion, replacing any earlier one, with actor and time;&lt;br/&gt;keep status, actual times, Presenter, documents and position (BR-309, BR-311)\nactivate AgendaItemRepository\nAgendaItemRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Save the conclusion, replacing any earlier one, with actor and time;&lt;br/&gt;keep status, actual times, Presenter, documents and position (BR-309, BR-311)\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;AgendaItemRepository: Conclusion saved / Save failed; earlier conclusion preserved\ndeactivate Database\nAgendaItemRepository--&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Conclusion saved / Save failed; earlier conclusion preserved\ndeactivate AgendaItemRepository\nalt Conclusion cannot be saved - EX-3\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG274 - Unable to save the agenda item conclusion. Please try again.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG274 - Unable to save the agenda item conclusion. Please try again.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Actor: MSG274 - Unable to save the agenda item conclusion. Please try again.\nelse Conclusion saved\nAgendaService-&gt;&gt;AgendaService: Automatically refresh the Agenda&lt;br/&gt;for currently authorized viewers (BR-73)\nAgendaService--&gt;&gt;AgendaController: MSG271 - Agenda item conclusion saved.\nAgendaController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG271 - Agenda item conclusion saved.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Actor: MSG271 - Agenda item conclusion saved.\nend\nend\nend\nend\ndeactivate AgendaService\ndeactivate AgendaController\ndeactivate MeetingPage&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" vertex="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=20;">
            <mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="3453.0" height="46.0" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
