  <diagram id="uc28a_addmeetingparticipant" name="UC-28a - Add Meeting Participant">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc28a_addmeetingparticipant" label="" mermaidData="{&amp;quot;data&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;%%{init: {\&amp;quot;sequence\&amp;quot;: {\&amp;quot;mirrorActors\&amp;quot;: false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
actor User as \&amp;quot;Meeting Organizer / Secretary\&amp;quot;
participant MeetingPage@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;boundary\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;Meeting Management Page\&amp;quot;
participant ParticipantController@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Participant Controller\&amp;quot;
participant ParticipantService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Participant Service\&amp;quot;
participant ParticipantRepository as \&amp;quot;:Meeting Participant Repository\&amp;quot;
participant Database@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;database\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Database\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationService as \&amp;quot;:Notification Service\&amp;quot;
User-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Submit selected internal users, shared role and additional permissions, or one Guest
activate MeetingPage
MeetingPage-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantController: Submit selected internal users, shared role and additional permissions, or one Guest
activate ParticipantController
ParticipantController-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantService: addMeetingParticipants(meeting, actor, selection)
activate ParticipantService
ParticipantService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantRepository: Read Meeting status, current internal and Guest roster,&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;actor relationship, roles and additional permissions
activate ParticipantRepository
ParticipantRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Retrieve current Meeting and roster information
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantRepository: Current information / Read failure
deactivate Database
ParticipantRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantService: Current information / Read failure
deactivate ParticipantRepository
ParticipantService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantService: Verify Organizer assigns one Secretary with no extras when none is current in Draft/Rejected/Approved,&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;including recovery after prior assignment/removal (BR-122),&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;or actor is a current Secretary (BR-78, BR-79, BR-175)
ParticipantService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantService: Require Draft, Rejected, Approved, Published or InProgress;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;validate every selected active user, uniqueness for additions; existing Member recovery changes role without adding a row; permitted extras (BR-80–BR-85, BR-168, BR-174)
alt Actor is no longer authorized - EX-2
ParticipantService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantController: Request denied; no participants added
ParticipantController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: Request denied; no participants added
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: Request denied; no participants added
else Meeting status disallows changes - EX-2
ParticipantService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantController: MSG98 - The meeting participant list cannot be modified in its current status.
ParticipantController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: MSG98 - The meeting participant list cannot be modified in its current status.
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: MSG98 - The meeting participant list cannot be modified in its current status.
else Internal selection is invalid - EX-1
ParticipantService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantController: MSG97 - Invalid meeting participant information.
ParticipantController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: MSG97 - Invalid meeting participant information.
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: MSG97 - Invalid meeting participant information.
else Additional permissions are invalid - EX-1
ParticipantService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantController: MSG152 - One or more selected meeting permissions are not allowed.
ParticipantController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: MSG152 - One or more selected meeting permissions are not allowed.
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: MSG152 - One or more selected meeting permissions are not allowed.
else Guest name/email is invalid or already represented - EX-1
ParticipantService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantController: MSG97 - Invalid meeting participant information.
ParticipantController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;MeetingPage: MSG97 - Invalid meeting participant information.
MeetingPage--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: MSG97 - Invalid meeting participant information.
else Selection is valid
alt Organizer restores Secretary using an existing active Member - AF-2
ParticipantService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantRepository: Assign current Member as Secretary; preserve response/attendance and identity;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;no duplicate participant or new optional grant (BR-78, BR-79, BR-122)
activate ParticipantRepository
ParticipantRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Save recovery role change; recheck no Secretary and preparation status
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantRepository: Complete save / No changes saved
ParticipantRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantService: Recovery result
deactivate Database
deactivate ParticipantRepository
else New internal users selected
ParticipantService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantRepository: Add all selected users with the shared role, permitted extras and Pending response;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;if any addition fails, add none (BR-88, BR-168)
activate ParticipantRepository
ParticipantRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Save all requested changes together;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;recheck Meeting status, authority and roster before saving
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantRepository: Complete save / No changes saved
deactivate Database
ParticipantRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantService: Complete save / No changes saved
deactivate ParticipantRepository
else One external Guest selected - AF-1
ParticipantService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantService: Confidential/Secret form displays inline warning only; no extra confirmation;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;record inviter, sensitivity and time (BR-182)
ParticipantService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantRepository: Create one Guest invitation with invited name/email and Pending response and Member participation access and selected additional grants;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;no internal account or internal meeting role; permitted additional Meeting grants from the agreed catalogue; not limited to two views (BR-84, BR-88, BR-148–BR-156)
activate ParticipantRepository
ParticipantRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Save all requested changes together;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;recheck Meeting status, authority and roster before saving
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantRepository: Complete save / No changes saved
deactivate Database
ParticipantRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;ParticipantService: Complete save / No changes saved
deactivate ParticipantRepository
end
