  <diagram id="uc29_respondtomeetinginvitation" name="UC-29 - Respond to Meeting Invitation">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc29_respondtomeetinginvitation" label="" mermaidData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;%%{init: {\&quot;sequence\&quot;: {\&quot;mirrorActors\&quot;: false}}}%%\nsequenceDiagram\nactor User as \&quot;Chair / Secretary / Participant / Guest\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingPage@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;boundary\&quot; } as \&quot;Meeting Management Page\&quot;\nparticipant ParticipantController@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Meeting Participant Controller\&quot;\nparticipant ParticipantService@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Meeting Participant Service\&quot;\nparticipant ParticipantRepository as \&quot;:Meeting Participant Repository\&quot;\nparticipant Database@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;database\&quot; } as \&quot;:Database\&quot;\nUser-&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: Submit Accepted or Declined for own invitation&lt;br/&gt;(question at the top of Meeting detail or on the calendar card)\nactivate MeetingPage\nMeetingPage-&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: Submit Accepted or Declined for own invitation\nactivate ParticipantController\nParticipantController-&gt;&gt;ParticipantService: respondToMeetingInvitation(meeting, invitee, response)\nactivate ParticipantService\nParticipantService-&gt;&gt;ParticipantRepository: Read Meeting status, current internal and Guest roster,&lt;br/&gt;actor relationship, roles and additional permissions\nactivate ParticipantRepository\nParticipantRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Retrieve current Meeting and roster information\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;ParticipantRepository: Current information / Read failure\ndeactivate Database\nParticipantRepository--&gt;&gt;ParticipantService: Current information / Read failure\ndeactivate ParticipantRepository\nParticipantService-&gt;&gt;ParticipantService: Verify invitation ownership, current invitation, Meeting Published/InProgress,&lt;br/&gt;valid Guest access established through UC-04, that the actor is not the Chair,&lt;br/&gt;and compare the value with any response already recorded (BR-104–BR-106, BR-153–BR-157)\nalt Response is invalid - EX-2\nParticipantService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: MSG106 - Invalid meeting invitation response.\nParticipantController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG106 - Invalid meeting invitation response.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;User: MSG106 - Invalid meeting invitation response.\nelse Actor is the Chair - EX-5\nParticipantService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: MSG286 - The Chair runs the Meeting, so no attendance confirmation is needed.\nParticipantController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG286 - The Chair runs the Meeting, so no attendance confirmation is needed.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;User: MSG286 - The Chair runs the Meeting, so no attendance confirmation is needed.\nelse Meeting or invitation no longer allows a response - EX-1\nParticipantService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: MSG107 - This meeting invitation can no longer be answered.\nParticipantController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG107 - This meeting invitation can no longer be answered.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;User: MSG107 - This meeting invitation can no longer be answered.\nelse A different response is already recorded - EX-4\nParticipantService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: MSG285 - You have already answered this invitation. Your answer cannot be changed.\nParticipantController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG285 - You have already answered this invitation. Your answer cannot be changed.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;User: MSG285 - You have already answered this invitation. Your answer cannot be changed.\nelse The same response is already recorded - AF-1\nParticipantService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: MSG154 - No changes to save.\nParticipantController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG154 - No changes to save.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;User: MSG154 - No changes to save.\nelse Response is allowed\nParticipantService-&gt;&gt;ParticipantRepository: Save the Accepted or Declined response and response time once;&lt;br/&gt;never replaced afterwards; attendance, roles, access and extras unchanged (BR-106, BR-115, BR-116, BR-321)\nactivate ParticipantRepository\nParticipantRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Save all requested changes together;&lt;br/&gt;recheck Meeting status, authority and roster before saving\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;ParticipantRepository: Complete save / No changes saved\ndeactivate Database\nParticipantRepository--&gt;&gt;ParticipantService: Complete save / No changes saved\ndeactivate ParticipantRepository\nalt Save fails - EX-2\nParticipantService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: MSG108 - Unable to save the meeting invitation response. Please try again.\nParticipantController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG108 - Unable to save the meeting invitation response. Please try again.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;User: MSG108 - Unable to save the meeting invitation response. Please try again.\nelse Response saved\nParticipantService--&gt;&gt;ParticipantController: MSG105 - Meeting invitation response recorded successfully.\nParticipantController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG105 - Meeting invitation response recorded successfully.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;User: MSG105 - Meeting invitation response recorded successfully.\nend\nend\ndeactivate ParticipantService\ndeactivate ParticipantController\ndeactivate MeetingPage\n&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=20;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="3307.0" height="46" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
