  <diagram id="uc67a_marknotificationasread" name="UC-67a - Mark Notification as Read">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc67a_marknotificationasread" label="" mermaidData="{&amp;quot;data&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;%%{init: {\&amp;quot;sequence\&amp;quot;: {\&amp;quot;mirrorActors\&amp;quot;: false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
actor User as \&amp;quot;Meeting Organizer / Meeting Approver / System Admin / Chair / Secretary / Participant\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationPanel@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;boundary\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;Notification Panel\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationController@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Notification Controller\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Notification Service\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationRepository as \&amp;quot;:Notification Repository\&amp;quot;
participant Database@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;database\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Database\&amp;quot;
User-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: Select \&amp;quot;Mark as Read\&amp;quot;
activate NotificationPanel
NotificationPanel-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: Mark notification as read
activate NotificationController
NotificationController-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Mark notification as read
activate NotificationService
NotificationService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Find notification for current user (BR-47)
activate NotificationRepository
NotificationRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Retrieve notification
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Notification result
NotificationRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Notification result
alt Notification does not exist or belongs to another user - EX-1
NotificationService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: Notification is not available
NotificationController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: This notification is no longer available
NotificationPanel--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: Display notification unavailable message
else Notification is available
NotificationService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Mark notification as read
NotificationRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Update notification read status
alt Read status cannot be saved - EX-2
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Update failed
NotificationRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Read status unchanged
NotificationService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: Unable to mark notification as read
NotificationController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: Unable to mark this notification as read.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;Please try again.
NotificationPanel--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: Display actual saved status and unread count
else Notification marked as read successfully
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Read status updated
NotificationRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Notification marked as read
NotificationService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Get latest unread count
NotificationRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Count unread notifications&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;for current user
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Unread count
NotificationRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Latest unread count
NotificationService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: Notification updated successfully&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;with unread count
NotificationController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: Refresh notification status&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;and unread badge
NotificationPanel--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: Display notification as read&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;and updated unread count
end
end
deactivate Database
deactivate NotificationRepository
deactivate NotificationService
deactivate NotificationController
deactivate NotificationPanel
&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;config&amp;quot;: null}">
