  <diagram id="uc68_opennotificationtarget" name="UC-68 - Open Notification Target">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc68_opennotificationtarget" label="" mermaidData="{&amp;quot;data&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;%%{init: {\&amp;quot;sequence\&amp;quot;: {\&amp;quot;mirrorActors\&amp;quot;: false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
actor User as \&amp;quot;Meeting Organizer / Meeting Approver / System Admin / Chair / Secretary / Participant\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationPanel@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;boundary\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;Notification Panel\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationController@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Notification Controller\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationService@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;control\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Notification Service\&amp;quot;
participant NotificationRepository as \&amp;quot;:Notification Repository\&amp;quot;
participant Database@{ \&amp;quot;type\&amp;quot;: \&amp;quot;database\&amp;quot; } as \&amp;quot;:Database\&amp;quot;
User-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: Select a notification
activate NotificationPanel
NotificationPanel-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: Open notification target
activate NotificationController
NotificationController-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Open notification target
activate NotificationService
NotificationService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Find notification for current user&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;(BR-47, BR-52)
activate NotificationRepository
NotificationRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Retrieve notification,&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;read status and linked target
activate Database
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Notification result
NotificationRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Notification result
alt Notification does not exist or belongs to another user - EX-1
NotificationService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: Notification is not available
NotificationController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: This notification is no longer available
NotificationPanel--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: Display notification unavailable message
else Notification is available
alt Notification is already read - AF-1
NotificationService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Keep read status and unread count unchanged&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;(BR-50)
else Notification is unread
NotificationService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Mark notification as read&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;(BR-48, BR-53)
NotificationRepository-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;Database: Update notification read status
alt Read status cannot be saved - EX-3
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Update failed
NotificationRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Read status remains unchanged
NotificationService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: Read status could not be saved
NotificationController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: Unable to mark the notification as read
else Read status saved successfully
Database--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationRepository: Read status updated
NotificationRepository--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Notification marked as read
end
end
NotificationService-&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationService: Check current access to linked meeting or task&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;(BR-29, BR-52)
alt Target no longer exists or user no longer has access - EX-2
NotificationService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: Target cannot be opened
NotificationController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: This meeting or task is no longer available to you.
NotificationPanel--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: Display access message without&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;revealing protected target content
else Target is available and user has access
NotificationService--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationController: Target can be opened
NotificationController--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;NotificationPanel: Navigate to linked meeting or task
NotificationPanel--&amp;gt;&amp;gt;User: Display linked meeting or task
end
end
deactivate Database
deactivate NotificationRepository
deactivate NotificationService
deactivate NotificationController
deactivate NotificationPanel
&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;config&amp;quot;: null}">
