  <diagram id="uc76a_attachdocumentstovote" name="UC-76a - Attach Documents to Vote">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="0" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject id="mermaid-uc76a_attachdocumentstovote" label="" mermaidData="{&quot;data&quot;: &quot;%%{init: {\&quot;sequence\&quot;: {\&quot;mirrorActors\&quot;: false}}}%%\nsequenceDiagram\nactor Actor as \&quot;Chair / Secretary\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingPage@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;boundary\&quot; } as \&quot;Meeting Management Page\&quot;\nparticipant VoteController@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Vote Controller\&quot;\nparticipant VoteService@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;control\&quot; } as \&quot;:Vote Service\&quot;\nparticipant ParticipantRepository as \&quot;:Meeting Participant Repository\&quot;\nparticipant VoteRepository as \&quot;:Vote Repository\&quot;\nparticipant MeetingDocumentRepository as \&quot;:Meeting Document Repository\&quot;\nparticipant PersonalDocumentRepository as \&quot;:Personal Document Repository\&quot;\nparticipant FileStorage as \&quot;:File Storage\&quot;\nparticipant Database@{ \&quot;type\&quot;: \&quot;database\&quot; } as \&quot;:Database\&quot;\nActor-&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: Confirm documents to attach to a Draft Vote&lt;br/&gt;(Meeting documents / Upload from computer / My Documents)\nactivate MeetingPage\nMeetingPage-&gt;&gt;VoteController: Attach documents to Vote\nactivate VoteController\nVoteController-&gt;&gt;VoteService: attachVoteDocuments(meetingId, voteId, actorId, source, documents)\nactivate VoteService\nVoteService-&gt;&gt;VoteRepository: Get Vote, its Meeting and current statuses\nactivate VoteRepository\nVoteRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Get Vote, its Meeting and current statuses\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;VoteRepository: Vote and Meeting / Not found\ndeactivate Database\nVoteRepository--&gt;&gt;VoteService: Vote and Meeting / Not found\ndeactivate VoteRepository\nVoteService-&gt;&gt;ParticipantRepository: Check current Chair or Secretary assignment\nactivate ParticipantRepository\nParticipantRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Check current Chair or Secretary assignment\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;ParticipantRepository: Current Chair or Secretary / Not eligible\ndeactivate Database\nParticipantRepository--&gt;&gt;VoteService: Current Chair or Secretary / Not eligible\ndeactivate ParticipantRepository\nalt Meeting or Vote not accessible - EX-5\nVoteService--&gt;&gt;VoteController: MSG205 - Meeting votes are not accessible.\nVoteController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG205 - Meeting votes are not accessible.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Actor: MSG205 - Meeting votes are not accessible.\nelse Vote documents can no longer be changed - EX-1\nVoteService--&gt;&gt;VoteController: MSG213 - Only Draft votes may be managed by the current Chair or Secretary&lt;br/&gt;while the meeting is Approved, Published or InProgress.\nVoteController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG213 - Only Draft votes may be managed by the current Chair or Secretary&lt;br/&gt;while the meeting is Approved, Published or InProgress.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Actor: MSG213 - Only Draft votes may be managed by the current Chair or Secretary&lt;br/&gt;while the meeting is Approved, Published or InProgress.\nelse Draft Vote, Meeting Approved, Published or InProgress (BR-252, BR-288)\nalt Source is Meeting documents - Main Flow\nVoteService-&gt;&gt;MeetingDocumentRepository: Check each document is still in the Meeting&lt;br/&gt;and not yet attached to the Vote (BR-287)\nactivate MeetingDocumentRepository\nMeetingDocumentRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Check each document is still in the Meeting&lt;br/&gt;and not yet attached to the Vote (BR-287)\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;MeetingDocumentRepository: Available / Not in Meeting / Already attached\ndeactivate Database\nMeetingDocumentRepository--&gt;&gt;VoteService: Available / Not in Meeting / Already attached\ndeactivate MeetingDocumentRepository\nelse Source is Upload from computer - AF-1\nVoteService-&gt;&gt;VoteService: Validate every file is PDF or DOCX, at most 50 MB (BR-187, BR-214, BR-215)\nVoteService-&gt;&gt;FileStorage: Store uploaded files\nactivate FileStorage\nFileStorage--&gt;&gt;VoteService: Stored files / Storage failed\ndeactivate FileStorage\nelse Source is My Documents - AF-2\nVoteService-&gt;&gt;PersonalDocumentRepository: Check each document belongs to the actor, is available&lt;br/&gt;and is not already in the Meeting (BR-193, BR-209)\nactivate PersonalDocumentRepository\nPersonalDocumentRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Check each document belongs to the actor, is available&lt;br/&gt;and is not already in the Meeting (BR-193, BR-209)\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;PersonalDocumentRepository: Available / Not available / Already in Meeting\ndeactivate Database\nPersonalDocumentRepository--&gt;&gt;VoteService: Available / Not available / Already in Meeting\ndeactivate PersonalDocumentRepository\nend\nalt Selection invalid\nVoteService--&gt;&gt;VoteController: MSG170 / MSG266 / MSG164 / MSG249 / MSG165 per failed check\nVoteController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG170 / MSG266 / MSG164 / MSG249 / MSG165 per failed check\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Actor: MSG170 / MSG266 / MSG164 / MSG249 / MSG165 per failed check\nelse Selection valid\nVoteService-&gt;&gt;VoteRepository: Recheck Vote is Draft; add new documents to the Meeting (and uploads to the&lt;br/&gt;uploader's library) and attach all to the Vote as one change (BR-194, BR-286, BR-304)\nactivate VoteRepository\nVoteRepository-&gt;&gt;Database: Save Meeting documents, library entries and Vote document links as one change\nactivate Database\nDatabase--&gt;&gt;VoteRepository: Attached / Save failed; nothing added or attached\ndeactivate Database\nVoteRepository--&gt;&gt;VoteService: Attached / Save failed; nothing added or attached\ndeactivate VoteRepository\nalt Change cannot be saved - EX-4\nVoteService--&gt;&gt;VoteController: MSG267 (Meeting documents) / MSG166 (Upload or My Documents)\nVoteController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG267 (Meeting documents) / MSG166 (Upload or My Documents)\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Actor: MSG267 (Meeting documents) / MSG166 (Upload or My Documents)\nelse Documents attached\nVoteService--&gt;&gt;VoteController: MSG265 - Documents attached to the vote successfully.\nVoteController--&gt;&gt;MeetingPage: MSG265 - Documents attached to the vote successfully.\nMeetingPage--&gt;&gt;Actor: MSG265 - Documents attached to the vote successfully.\nend\nend\nend\ndeactivate VoteService\ndeactivate VoteController\ndeactivate MeetingPage&quot;, &quot;config&quot;: null}">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" vertex="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=20;">
            <mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="3642.0" height="46.0" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="title-uc76a_attachdocumentstovote" value="UC-76a - Attach Documents to Vote" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#000000;">
          <mxGeometry x="0.0" y="0" width="3642.0" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="Chair / Secretary" mermaidId="n:Actor" mermaidBaseStyle="html=1;shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;sequenceEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;libavoidRouting&quot;:0,&quot;curved&quot;:0,&quot;rounded&quot;:0};lifelineDashed=0;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=6;lifelineColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);participant=seqActorStick;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;spacingBottom=4;size=90;lifelineMirror=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ECECFF,#1f2020);strokeColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" mermaidBaseValue="Chair / Secretary" id="2">
